  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6170d1c959a2065d6b794816b2a5ef88, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Shanaia01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CaseClosed.Data.DialogueTreeSO
  treeId: TREE_SHANAIA_01
  characterId: CHAR_SHANAIA_ORTEGA
  startNodeId: NODE_01
  nodes:
  - nodeId: NODE_01
    speakerId: CHAR_SHANAIA_ORTEGA
    speakerName: Shanaia Ortega
    expression: 10
    statementText: Once our 5:30 PM meeting wrapped up, I went straight home. I didn't
      contact Kurt or return to the cafe for the rest of the night.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_01B_SHAN_STATEMENT
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_01B_SHAN_STATEMENT
    speakerId: CHAR_SHAN_JARABA
    speakerName: Shan Jaraba
    expression: 8
    statementText: Detective, as cafe manager on duty until 7:30 PM closing, I heard
      the back exit service chime ring around 7:10 PM. Someone returned through the
      alley.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_01C_SHANAIA_DISMISS
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_01C_SHANAIA_DISMISS
    speakerId: CHAR_SHANAIA_ORTEGA
    speakerName: Shanaia Ortega
    expression: 6
    statementText: Shan, mind your own business! You were balancing the cash register
      at the front counter. You couldn't see through the back corridor!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_01D_DETECTIVE_INTERVIEW
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_01D_DETECTIVE_INTERVIEW
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: Let Shan finish, Shanaia. Kurt's smartphone call log and the security
      captures will establish whether anyone returned.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_02_PHONE_LEAD
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_02_PHONE_LEAD
    speakerId: CHAR_SHANAIA_ORTEGA
    speakerName: Shanaia Ortega
    expression: 10
    statementText: Kurt's phone contains nothing useful. You should focus on the
      afternoon meeting, not his private calls.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_02B_SHAN_ALARMED
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete:
    - EVD_CCTV_STILL
  - nodeId: NODE_02B_SHAN_ALARMED
    speakerId: CHAR_SHAN_JARABA
    speakerName: Shan Jaraba
    expression: 2
    statementText: Actually, Kurt seemed frantic right after an encrypted incoming
      call at 7:15 PM. He slammed his office door and locked it.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_02C_DETECTIVE_CCTV
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_02C_DETECTIVE_CCTV
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: An encrypted call at 7:15 PM... The security still from the cafe's
      back exit camera should verify who arrived right before that call.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: 
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_03_CCTV_LEAD
    speakerId: CHAR_SHANAIA_ORTEGA
    speakerName: Shanaia Ortega
    expression: 2
    statementText: The back exit camera is unreliable. It could not possibly show
      me there after I left.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_03B_SHAN_JACKET
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete:
    - EVD_RESIGNATION_LETTER
  - nodeId: NODE_03B_SHAN_JACKET
    speakerId: CHAR_SHAN_JARABA
    speakerName: Shan Jaraba
    expression: 8
    statementText: Shanaia, that embroidered denim jacket in the camera still...
      you wore that exact jacket to work today. No one else has one.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_03C_CONFIRMATION
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_03C_CONFIRMATION
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: The call log records a 10-minute incoming call from your phone
      at 7:15 PM, and the camera captures your return at 7:10 PM. What were you doing
      in Kurt's office?
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_03D_DETECTIVE_DRAFT
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_03D_DETECTIVE_DRAFT
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: And why did Kurt have a termination notice drafted in his briefcase
      accusing you of data theft?
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_04_FINAL_STATEMENT
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_04_FINAL_STATEMENT
    speakerId: CHAR_SHANAIA_ORTEGA
    speakerName: Shanaia Ortega
    expression: 10
    statementText: Once I left at 5:30 PM, I never returned to that cafe. That is
      the timeline.
    isChallengeable: 1
    targetContradictionRuleId: RULE_SHANAIA_TIMELINE_LIE
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: 
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_05_CONFESSION
    speakerId: CHAR_SHANAIA_ORTEGA
    speakerName: Shanaia Ortega
    expression: 3
    statementText: Fine! Kurt discovered I was exporting our proprietary ordering
      code to a competitor! He drafted that notice to ruin me, so I broke in at 7:10
      PM to wipe his drive!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_05B_SHAN_DISAPPOINTED
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_05B_SHAN_DISAPPOINTED
    speakerId: CHAR_SHAN_JARABA
    speakerName: Shan Jaraba
    expression: 4
    statementText: Shanaia... Kurt gave you your start in tech. How could you steal
      his life's work for rival money?
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_05C_SHANAIA_BITTER
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_05C_SHANAIA_BITTER
    speakerId: CHAR_SHANAIA_ORTEGA
    speakerName: Shanaia Ortega
    expression: 3
    statementText: He took credit for all my software optimizations while paying
      me barista wages! I took back what was mine!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_05D_DETECTIVE_CLOSE
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_05D_DETECTIVE_CLOSE
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: Your digital footprint betrayed your timeline. Shanaia Ortega,
      you are under arrest for commercial espionage, cyber theft, and unlawful entry.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: 
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
